        "comments": "In Sept 2021 the 16,584 alternative haploid contigs (haplotigs) of assembly ValleyOak3.1 (LRBV02002015-LRBV02018598) were suppressed. Consequently, this updated assembly version (ValleyOak3.2; GCA_001633185.5) is a standard haploid assembly.\n\nThe chloroplast sequence in LRBV02000011 was updated on June 2020.\n\nIn August 2021 eight sequences were removed because they are contaminants, and the assembly name was updated to ValleyOak3.1. The accessions of those eight are LRBV02000234.1, LRBV02000274.1, LRBV02000464.1, LRBV02000532.1, LRBV02000701.1, LRBV02000726.1, LRBV02000790.1, LRBV02000989.1.",
